  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The established use of the of&amp;nbsp;second of the premise is office (Use Class E(g(i))). The proposed use of Room 223&amp;nbsp;on the second floor at 429-433 Pinner Road as a taxi control office would not result in a material change of use from Use Class E. Therefore, the proposed use of the site as a taxi control office would not constitute a material change of use and therefore, would not constitute development as defined by section 55 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) and as defined by Article 3 sub-paragraph (1A) of the Town and Country Planning (Use Classes Order) 1987 (as amended).&amp;nbsp;The proposal is therefore a lawful development.&lt;/p&gt;"
